# Pin the line endings of the source files.
#
# This repository stores LF. Without a rule, an editor or a script that writes in
# text mode on Windows silently converts a file to CRLF, and because the stored blob
# is LF every single line then shows as changed — a 500-line edit appeared as a
# 3000-line diff. That happened twice while developing the overlay, and both times it
# cost a debugging round to notice the diff was almost entirely noise.
#
# `eol=lf` in the index and the working tree makes the conversion impossible.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must not be touched.
*.vsix binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.zst binary
